<title>PHILIPPINES: Sanwa Bank gets nod to open Manila office.</title>
<headline>Sanwa Bank gets nod to open Manila office.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank said on Monday it had approved the application of Sanwa Bank to open a representative office.</p>
<p>Central Bank Governor Gabriel Singson said the entry of Sanwa Bank represented another vote of confidence by Japanese investors in the continued growth of the Philippine economy.</p>
<p>Sanwa Bank currently owns 25 percent of Rizal Commercial Banking Corp.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
